<h2><strong>Family-Friendly Activities During the 2026 Tournament:</strong></h2>
<ul>
<li>Bass Pro Archery Shooting Lane to test the 2026 Bow of the Year!</li>
<li class="p3">Shoot against Joella Bates, 13-time World Champion Archery</li>
<li class="p3">Scavenger Hunt</li>
<li>Johnny Morris&#8217; Wonders of Wildlife, Thursday, March 19</li>
<li>MoNASP Raffle supporting conservation programs across the state</li>
